The exact dependency set and versions are pinned in Cargo.lock and in the package-lock.json files under app/, relayer/, services/ and tools/.
Components this repository builds on or interoperates with include the NEAR SDK and near-workspaces, near-api-js, the Solana web3.js and SPL token libraries,
the Squads multisig program and SDK, the Jito merkle distributor program (a patched rehearsal copy was used on devnet only), Meteora (spike only),
the NEAR Intents contracts (a hash-pinned wasm is fetched read-only for tests), Next.js, React and Tailwind CSS. Their licenses apply to their code.
The thesis data is described in thesis/THESIS.md. Nothing here is an offer of securities, and no mainnet deployment is claimed.
